# Line endings
#
# Everything text is stored AND checked out as LF, on every platform. The
# previous `* text=auto` stored LF but handed Windows CRLF on checkout, so the
# working tree drifted from the repository and editors warned on every file.
#
# LF is the right target here: the API runs on Linux in production, and the
# .mjs scripts are executed there too.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never convert these, it corrupts them.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.mp4   binary

# Generated — keep them out of diffs and language stats.
package-lock.json  -diff linguist-generated
data/products.seed.json  -diff linguist-generated
